      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "We already had a 6.6kW solar system with a 5kW inverter, along with a 15.36kWh solar battery installed by another provider. As we looked into options for adding more panels to boost production during the winter months, we came across Solarhunters through Solarquotes.com.au. The first person to reach out was Tony, one of the owners.From the beginning, Tony was patient, approachable, and genuinely interested in understanding our current setup. He took the time to explain whether we actually needed additional panels and was always quick to respond whenever we reached out. At no point did we feel pressured or oversold—he understood that we were also speaking with other companies and respected that process.No question was too small, and Tony’s professionalism and friendly approach stood out. Even though we received similar quotes from another provider, his service made all the difference. He went the extra mile, personally contacting the manufacturer and relevant authorities to ensure our new 8.16kW system could be properly integrated with our existing battery inverter. This not only saved us hours of potential configuration issues but also passed savings directly on to us.Because of Tony’s exceptional service, we chose Solarhunters for our solar expansion, and we could not be happier with the decision.Alvin & Shirhan",
